            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An apparatus (1) is provided for enabling smokable material to be heated to volatise at least one component of the smokable material. The apparatus (1) has a housing and a capacitive sensor (12,13,15) arranged to sense a change in capacitance when an article of smokable material comprising a rod of smokable material is inserted into the housing in use. Further, the apparatus (1) is configured to enable heating of the rod of smokable material of the article of smokable material received in the housing.</p>
            </abstract>
